exports[`spine full axis matrix (16 representative cells) > baseline-realistic-cinematic: stable spine + body[0] structural fields 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "The dependency ledger leaked, and everyone finally saw the multiplier. The fight belongs to the narrow-AI stabilizer substrate and Tarandus Route-211 II - Moon I Station; the bleeding is done at Tarandus Route-211 Belt IV Freeport 56. Nobody pretends anymore; the boundary lines get repainted in daylight. The fire is out, and everyone is still counting what it took. Bone Lantern Order came for the final say over who docks and who drifts; what Iron Crown Cabal has left to lose is a workforce that will scatter the day the contract breaks. Both sides run ferries past the wreck site, and both slow down without announcing why. The narrow-AI stabilizer substrate wants the authority to declare what counts as contaminated. Tarandus Route-211 Belt IV Freeport 56 wants tomorrow. Tarandus Route-211 VI Hold wants the freight surcharge to stop climbing. It was always going to come to this, because the dependency was supposed to be temporary; the paperwork still says so. And buried under all of it, patient as ice: the maintenance logs were rewritten after the breach. The memorial wall lists the dead by name; the plaque naming a cause has been replaced twice. What Tarandus Route-211 Belt IV gives, Tarandus Route-211 Belt IV can take back; Tarandus Route-211 Belt IV Freeport 56 builds accordingly. There, Tarandus Route-211 VI Hold was built on the promise of Narrow-AI stabilizer substrate, and promises out here have interest rates.",
